WEBVTT
Language: en-IN

00:00:07.042 --> 00:00:08.873
<v Gopal>Yes, sir, this is Gopal.

00:00:08.873 --> 00:00:10.398
<v Gopal>A parcel in my name?

00:00:10.398 --> 00:00:11.771
<v Gopal>With drugs inside?

00:00:11.771 --> 00:00:14.212
<v Gopal>Sir, I have never sent a parcel.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:15.164
<v Gopal>Arrested?

00:00:15.164 --> 00:00:17.376
<v Gopal>Right now, on this video call?

00:00:17.376 --> 00:00:20.031
<v Gopal>Please, sir, I am a retired teacher.

00:00:20.031 --> 00:00:22.243
<v Gopal>Which account do I send it to?

00:00:22.542 --> 00:00:27.096
<v Ira>Papa? Who are you sending money to? Put
the phone down for one minute. Just one.

00:00:27.375 --> 00:00:29.147
<v Gopal>It is the police, beta.

00:00:29.147 --> 00:00:30.457
<v Gopal>A digital arrest.

00:00:30.457 --> 00:00:34.000
<v Gopal>He says I must stay on
camera and tell nobody.

00:00:34.292 --> 00:00:35.929
<v Ira>There is no such thing.

00:00:35.929 --> 00:00:41.340
<v Ira>Police, CBI, customs, judges: nobody
arrests anyone on a video call. Nobody.

00:00:41.625 --> 00:00:47.539
<v Gopal>But he had a uniform. A badge. Flags
behind him, like a real police station.

00:00:47.833 --> 00:00:49.500
<v Ira>Anyone can buy a uniform.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.969
<v Ira>That police station is a
painted wall behind a desk.

00:00:52.969 --> 00:00:54.236
<v Ira>Cut the call, Papa.

00:00:54.542 --> 00:00:59.041
<v Gopal>Two hours I sat here, sweating.
I did not even tell your mother.

00:00:59.333 --> 00:01:03.363
<v Ira>That is the trick. Fear, hurry,
and keep it secret. Did any money go?

00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:08.076
<v Gopal>Not one rupee. I was looking for
my passbook when you walked in.

00:01:08.375 --> 00:01:08.708
<v Ira>Good.

00:01:08.708 --> 00:01:12.042
<v Ira>Now we report that number
on sancharsaathi.gov.in,

00:01:12.042 --> 00:01:14.309
<v Ira>so it cannot frighten anyone else.

00:01:14.625 --> 00:01:16.764
<v Gopal>And if the money had gone?

00:01:17.042 --> 00:01:21.629
<v Ira>Then 1930 at once, the cyber crime
helpline, or cybercrime.gov.in.

00:01:21.629 --> 00:01:25.034
<v Ira>The sooner, the better
the chance of stopping it.

00:01:25.333 --> 00:01:31.530
<v Gopal>No arrest on a video call. 1930.
I am telling the whole society tonight.
